Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?nebula:=20=C2=A712.4=20wire=20debug.rw-check=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?+=20replay-record=20config=20flags?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Both flags previously had accessors but no consumers (dead config).
Now:
- nebula.debug.rw-check: true now activates RW-Guard tracing
  (in addition to -Dnebula.guard=true). Routes through
  NebulaGuardIntegration static init.
- nebula.debug.replay-record: true activates per-tick structural
  state-hash logging to logs/nebula-replay.log via new
  NebulaReplayIntegration. Hook fires at end of each
  ServerLevel.nebula\$tickViaDAG.
- /nebula replay command surfaces recorder status.

Closes the §12.4 dead-config gap surfaced by P5 architecture audit.

